---
layout: base.njk
title: "Resources | Free Tools, Forms & Guides for Businesses"
description: "Free tools, standard forms, guides and checklists from VidhiCorp Legal Chambers to help business owners and corporate legal counsel assess their position and plan next steps."
permalink: /resources/
metaTitle: "Free Legal Tools, Forms & Guides | VidhiCorp"
metaDescription: "Free calculators and checklists for Indian businesses, including ESOP dilution and POSH compliance, plus standard forms and guides."
---
<section class="page-hero has-photo grain">
  <div class="ph-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=1400&q=55&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" width="1400" height="933" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Resources</p>
    <h1>Resources</h1>
    <p>Tools to help you in business and make informed decisions. Our free calculators are designed to assist you in understanding the numbers, assessing your position and planning your next step.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Free tools</p>
        <h2>Calculators &amp; checklists.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pa-grid reveal" style="grid-template-columns:repeat({{ tools.length }},1fr)">
      {% for tool in tools %}
      <a class="pa-card" href="{{ tool.url }}" data-bg="{{ tool.image }}">
        <span class="pa-card-img" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pa-card-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="pa-card-body">
          <svg class="pa-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4">{{ tool.iconSvg | safe }}</svg>
          <h3>{{ tool.title }}</h3>
          <div class="pa-card-more"><p>{{ tool.desc }}</p></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="mt-24" style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-muted)">More tools are added regularly — including a Stamp Duty Calculator, Tax Calculator and further compliance checklists.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Standard forms</p>
        <h2>Start a conversation with the chambers.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rows reveal-stagger">
      {% for r in resources %}
      <div class="row-item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr{% if not loop.last %}{% else %};border-bottom:1px solid var(--border){% endif %}">
        <h3 style="font-size:18px">{{ r.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ r.desc }} <a href="{{ r.url }}" style="color:var(--accent-strong)">{{ r.linkLabel }} &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "newsletter.njk" %}
